<navigation-bar warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="老人基本情况" back="{{backEnabled}}" guardBack="{{true}}" fallbackUrl="/pages/assessment/intro" bind:navigationfail="onNavigationFailure" color="#111827" background="#FBFAF7"></navigation-bar>
<page-container extraClass="assessment-page">
  <view class="page-shell assessment-readable" style="{{fontStyle}}">
    <progress-header warmSwiss="{{true}}" current="1" total="6" label="养老需求评估"></progress-header>
    <text class="basic-intro">先了解老人的基本生活情况。草稿成功保存在本机后，回来可以继续；请留意页面底部的保存提示。</text>
    <view wx:if="{{formError}}" class="form-error" role="alert">{{formError}}</view>

    <view class="basic-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">01</text><text>您与老人是什么关系？</text></view>
      <view id="{{relationshipAnchorId}}" class="question-anchor" style="padding-top: {{warmSwissHeaderHeight}}px; margin-top: -{{warmSwissHeaderHeight}}px;">
        <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="老人与您的关系" required="{{true}}" error="{{relationshipError}}">
          <single-choice warmSwiss="{{true}}" options="{{relationshipOptions}}" value="{{relationship}}" bindchange="onRelationshipChange"></single-choice>
        </question-section>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="basic-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">02</text><text>老人基本信息</text></view>
      <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="老人姓名" hint="选填，仅用于家庭档案识别">
        <input class="text-input" value="{{elderName}}" maxlength="20" placeholder="请输入老人姓名" bindinput="onNameInput" />
      </question-section>
      <view id="{{genderAnchorId}}" class="question-anchor" style="padding-top: {{warmSwissHeaderHeight}}px; margin-top: -{{warmSwissHeaderHeight}}px;">
        <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="性别" required="{{true}}" error="{{genderError}}">
          <single-choice warmSwiss="{{true}}" options="{{genderOptions}}" value="{{gender}}" bindchange="onGenderChange"></single-choice>
        </question-section>
      </view>
      <view id="{{ageAnchorId}}" class="question-anchor" style="padding-top: {{warmSwissHeaderHeight}}px; margin-top: -{{warmSwissHeaderHeight}}px;">
        <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="年龄" required="{{true}}" hint="请输入 50–110 岁的整数" error="{{ageError}}">
          <view class="age-field"><input class="text-input age-input" type="number" value="{{ageInput}}" maxlength="3" placeholder="例如：78" bindinput="onAgeInput" /><text>岁</text></view>
        </question-section>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="basic-section">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">03</text><text>居住与照护情况</text></view>
      <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="目前居住状态" hint="选填，帮助顾问理解当前生活环境">
        <single-choice warmSwiss="{{true}}" options="{{livingStatusOptions}}" value="{{livingStatus}}" bindchange="onLivingStatusChange"></single-choice>
      </question-section>
      <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="主要照护者" hint="选填，请选择目前承担主要照护责任的一方；如多人共同照护，请选择主要负责人。">
        <single-choice warmSwiss="{{true}}" options="{{caregiverOptions}}" value="{{primaryCaregiver}}" bindchange="onCaregiverChange"></single-choice>
      </question-section>
    </view>

    <view class="basic-section basic-section--last">
      <view class="ws-section-heading"><text class="ws-section-number">04</text><text>是否有养老机构入住经历</text></view>
      <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" title="养老机构入住经历" hint="选填，帮助了解过去的照护体验">
        <single-choice warmSwiss="{{true}}" options="{{experienceOptions}}" value="{{hasInstitutionExperience}}" bindchange="onExperienceChange"></single-choice>
      </question-section>
      <question-section warmSwiss="{{true}}" wx:if="{{hasInstitutionExperience === 'true'}}" title="离开上一家机构的主要原因" hint="可多选，选择您认为重要的原因">
        <multi-choice warmSwiss="{{true}}" options="{{exitReasonOptions}}" values="{{institutionExitReasons}}" bindchange="onExitReasonChange"></multi-choice>
      </question-section>
    </view>
    <text class="save-status">{{saveStatus}}</text>
    <assessment-footer warmSwiss="{{true}}" backText="{{backText}}" bindback="onBack" bindnext="onNext"></assessment-footer>
  </view>
</page-container>
